---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { formatDate } from "../utils/formatDate";

const updatedAt = new Date("2026-10-25T00:00:00Z");
---

<BaseLayout title="Now" description="What Tony Su is focused on now.">
  <article class="page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Now</p>
    <h1>A few things lately.</h1>
    <p class="updated-date">
      Updated <time datetime={updatedAt.toISOString()}
        >{formatDate(updatedAt)}</time>
    </p>
    <div class="content-section body-copy">
      <p>
        Working in Ad Tech and exploring an AI social discovery product outside
        work.
      </p>
      <p>
        Preparing a new <a href="/about#podcast">podcast with Nash</a>. Name and
        launch date to come.
      </p>
      <p>
        Making time for drums, tennis, and meeting curious people around the Bay
        Area.
      </p>
    </div>
    <details class="translation" lang="zh-Hant">
      <summary>中文近況</summary>
      <div class="body-copy">
        <p>
          在廣告科技領域工作，下班後探索 AI social discovery 產品，也和 Nash
          籌備新 Podcast。生活裡繼續打鼓、打網球，認識灣區有趣的人。
        </p>
      </div>
    </details>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
